==Battleground==
*4 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zamelle]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Big Sal]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]], as he is an excellent way to deal with Zamelle. In addition to him, make sure to have plenty of Zombie Killers!

The easiest way to win is to Z-Kill Zamelle with either Shigong Cat or the [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] as soon as possible, then stall Big Sal with [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight]] and/or [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Paragon Cat]]. Your Shigong Cats should be able to destroy the base relatively quickly, thanks in part to the lack of enemies in this stage. You can use rushers like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] to speed up the process.

